        "TileImage": "$($repository 3775934a-a9ef-40c9-a1ee-b4d4e1866450).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47\rYour target is Clodoveo Rametta. A former Italian mafioso, specializing in child trafficking. He was the main supplier of test subjects for USSR scientists during the last 20 years of the Soviet Union and now lives under a false name as the owner of an art gallery in the small town of Vernaza. The atrocities he committed are countless, earning him the nickname of &quot;monster&quot;.\rOur client, a former victim of Rametta, wants him to pay for the childhood he stole from her. \rGood luck 47",
